{"seq":3,"slug":"statistics-for-research","title":"科研统计方法","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research","introMarkdown":"# 科研统计方法 简介\n\n统计方法是实证研究的语言，是研究生从数据中提取知识、检验假设和支撑论证的基本工具。无论研究领域偏向自然科学还是社会科学，扎实的统计素养都能让研究设计更严谨、结论更可信。\n\n本课程以科研实际需求为导向，从基础理论回顾到高级分析方法，再到主流统计软件的实操训练，共设四个章节，为自学者构建一条从理论到应用的完整学习路径。\n\n第一章**统计学基础回顾**帮助学习者重新巩固概率分布、假设检验和置信区间这三块统计推断的基石。对于已有本科统计基础的学习者，这一章是查漏补缺的理想起点；对于跨专业的学习者，这里提供了必要的入门准备。\n\n第二章**回归与建模**进入应用最广泛的统计建模领域。线性回归、逻辑回归和多层模型分别对应连续变量预测、二分类问题和嵌套数据结构三类典型场景，掌握它们几乎可以应对大多数社会科学和行为科学的分析需求。\n\n第三章**高级统计方法**深入到更复杂的分析技术。因子分析用于提取潜在构念，结构方程模型可以同时处理测量模型和结构模型，贝叶斯推断则为传统频率学派框架提供了灵活的替代视角。这些方法在前沿研究中出现频率越来越高。\n\n第四章**统计软件与实践**将理论落地到具体工具。R 语言的灵活编程能力、Python 生态的科学计算优势、以及 SPSS 和 Stata 在特定学科中的广泛使用，使学习者可以根据自身需要选择合适的分析平台。\n\n建议学习者先通读第一章确认基础扎实，然后根据自己的研究方向选择第二章或第三章重点深入，最后在第四章中选取一种工具进行动手实操。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"statistical-foundations","title":"统计学基础回顾","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/statistical-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"probability-distributions","title":"研究生 科研统计方法 — 概率分布","url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/statistical-foundations/probability-distributions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hypothesis-testing","title":"研究生 科研统计方法 — 假设检验","url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/statistical-foundations/hypothesis-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"confidence-intervals","title":"研究生 科研统计方法 — 置信区间","url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/statistical-foundations/confidence-intervals"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"regression-modeling","title":"回归与建模","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/regression-modeling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"linear-regression","title":"研究生 科研统计方法 — 线性回归","url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/regression-modeling/linear-regression"},{"seq":2,"slug":"logistic-regression","title":"研究生 科研统计方法 — 逻辑回归","url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/regression-modeling/logistic-regression"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multilevel-models","title":"研究生 科研统计方法 — 多层模型（层次线性模型）","url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/regression-modeling/multilevel-models"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"advanced-methods","title":"高级统计方法","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/advanced-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"factor-analysis","title":"研究生 科研统计方法 — 因子分析","url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/advanced-methods/factor-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"structural-equation-modeling","title":"研究生 科研统计方法 — 结构方程模型","url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/advanced-methods/structural-equation-modeling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bayesian-inference","title":"研究生 科研统计方法 — 贝叶斯推断","url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/advanced-methods/bayesian-inference"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"software-tools","title":"统计软件与实践","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/software-tools","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"r-for-research","title":"研究生 科研统计方法 — R 语言科研应用","url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/software-tools/r-for-research"},{"seq":2,"slug":"python-scipy-stats","title":"研究生 科研统计方法 — Python 科学计算与统计","url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/software-tools/python-scipy-stats"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spss-stata-guide","title":"研究生 科研统计方法 — SPSS 与 Stata 入门","url":"/education/graduate/common-foundations/statistics-for-research/software-tools/spss-stata-guide"}]}]}